    "The topbar frames product identity first, then exposes navigation and actions in a single horizontal line.",
    "Marketing topbars use a dark inverted shell, while dashboard topbars switch to a white surface with the same linear rhythm.",
    "Micro-controls such as language toggles and connect actions keep the same mono uppercase treatment as buttons."
  ],
  "usageHints": [
    "Use --layout-topbar-height to keep a consistent header rhythm across pages.",
    "Dark topbars invert to --color-surface-inverse with light text, while dashboard topbars return to --color-surface.",
    "Controls should align on a strict baseline and avoid ornamental separators."
  ],
